				\begin{document}$$\textit{Smchd1}^{mat\Delta }$$\end{document}Smchd1matΔ samples was indistinguishable from that of wild-type samples, consistent with the restored imprinted Xist expression by E3.5 (Fig. 4a). Expression from the active X chromosome was also largely normal in heterozygous and \documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
