				\begin{document}$$\textit{Smchd1}^{mat\Delta }$$\end{document}Smchd1matΔ samples (Fig. 4b, left panels). From the paternal inactive X however, 36 out of 179 informative genes were upregulated (informative: expressed and containing a SNP; 5% FDR) in heterozygous samples (Fig. 4b, top right panel), while 107 out of 213 informative genes (5% FDR) were upregulated in the \documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
