				\begin{document}$$\textit{Smchd1}^{mat\Delta }$$\end{document}Smchd1matΔ samples (Fig. 4b, bottom right panel). There were 34 X-linked genes that were upregulated in both genotypes (Fig. 4c). These common genes tended to have larger \documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
